Package: directCareData
Title: Reference Market Data for Direct Care Practice Planning
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Anthony W.", "Raborn", , "anthony@raborndecisionsciences.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Bundled reference data describing the market a direct care
    practice would launch into: county-level population and household
    income (Census ACS), uninsured population estimates (SAHIE),
    physician density (NPPES), geography crosswalks (ZIP to county,
    county to metro area), and a curated directory of existing direct
    care practices. Data is refreshed and versioned independently of the
    packages that consume it (directCarePlanR, and potentially others).
    This package exports data only; it contains no business logic.
